From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:27:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Drop profile picture requests while disconnected

The downloader is meant to skip requests while not connected, but the
condition used "&&": it was only true when the client was nil and not
connected at the same time, so requests were never dropped while the
client existed but was disconnected. Use "||".

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/hoehermann/purple-gowhatsapp/pull/299]
---
 profile.go | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/profile.go b/profile.go
index 38a4281..4a2672d 100644
--- a/profile.go
+++ b/profile.go
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@ func (handler *Handler) profile_picture_downloader() {
 			log.Infof("Profile picture downloader has been removed.")
 			return
 		}
-		if handler.client == nil && !handler.client.IsConnected() {
+		if handler.client == nil || !handler.client.IsConnected() {
 			// drop requests while not connected to WhatsApp
 			continue
 		}
